{
  "uid": "homelab-slo",
  "title": "Homelab \u2014 SLO & SLA",
  "description": "Service level objectives (14-day rolling, with burn-rate alerting) and SLA view (calendar month, per service).",
  "tags": [
    "homelab",
    "slo"
  ],
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Homelab",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "homelab"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "datasource": null,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "\n**SLO** (objective, internal): availability measured by blackbox probes every 30s, over a **14-day rolling window**.\nBurn-rate alerts page when the budget burns too fast: **fast burn** (14.4x, 1h and 5m) is critical, **slow burn** (6x, 6h and 30m) is a warning.\n\n| Objective | Target | Error budget (14 days) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Local sites (`*.homelab.lan`) | 99.5% | 101 min |\n| Public sites (`*.darkestserver.com`) | 99.5% | 101 min |\n| DNS (AdGuard) | 99.9% | 20 min |\n\n**SLA** (promise, per service): availability for the **calendar month so far**, target **99.5%** = at most **3 h 36 min** of downtime in a 30-day month.\n"
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Local sites (*.homelab.lan) \u2014 objective 99.5%",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Availability (14d)",
      "description": "",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "slo:availability:14d{scope=\"local\"}",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.995
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.9975
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 3
        },
        "overrides": []
